{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b90d6c26cf328547aeb4df23b0827a2b.poster.avif?t=1771947097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b90d6c26cf328547aeb4df23b0827a2b.webm?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b90d6c26cf328547aeb4df23b0827a2b.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SWARM SURVIVORS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>GREX</strong>, <i>you don\u2019t play a hero \u2014 you command a living swarm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Grexlings move, fight, and sacrifice themselves as one organism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do things no single character could ever pull off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/99b9bdc87ab2e9682a082def938bbc02.poster.avif?t=1771947097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/99b9bdc87ab2e9682a082def938bbc02.webm?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/99b9bdc87ab2e9682a082def938bbc02.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>CONTROL THE UNCONTROLLABLE</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm AI Combat</strong> \u2013 Your Grexlings dodge, chase, collide, and intercept automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body as Weapon</strong> \u2013 Ram enemies, surround them, shred them, overwhelm them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mass Sacrifice &amp; Rebirth</strong> \u2013 Lose dozens, rebuild instantly, and come back stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape-Shifting</strong> \u2013 Use different shapes and formations to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.poster.avif?t=1771947097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.webm?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CRAFT YOUR PERFECT SWARM</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genes</strong> \u2013 Combine gene types to create unique Grexling behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merging</strong> \u2013 Fuse genes into higher tiers for absurd power jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive Items</strong> \u2013 Heavy bonuses with real trade-offs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Level up, boost stats, and evolve your swarm\u2019s instinct.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging</strong> \u2013 Tear through the arena floor to find healing and diamonds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.poster.avif?t=1771947097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.webm?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent skill tree upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game on purpose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DISCOVER. MUTATE. REPEAT.</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New swarm species that changes playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare items and exotic genes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless builds that change <i>how your entire organism behaves</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP \u2014 more on the way.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FINAL CHALLENGE: &quot;Vanilla Mode&quot;</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset Skill Tree &amp; upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the <strong>final boss</strong> in pure vanilla chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MUSIC, POWER,  VFX</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GREX is powered by a thumping <strong>trance-techno soundtrack</strong> and glowy <strong>neon VFX</strong> \u2014 swirling trails, pulsing lights, and particle storms that turn your swarm into a cosmic supernova.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREX</strong> blends bullet-heaven chaos with deep buildcraft - but the star is your swarm.<br>Learn it. Shape it. Weaponize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you control the chaos you create?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun Swarming,<br>Mike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415870?t=1771947097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/1f7247d039ded3c64c6dacd1cb327b98a3493ede/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771947097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/5cf26fbe25b68bc450af6b496a3f358259d959c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771947097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/5cf26fbe25b68bc450af6b496a3f358259d959c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771947097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3526610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b90d6c26cf328547aeb4df23b0827a2b.poster.avif?t=1771947097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b90d6c26cf328547aeb4df23b0827a2b.webm?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b90d6c26cf328547aeb4df23b0827a2b.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SWARM SURVIVORS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>GREX</strong>, <i>you don\u2019t play a hero \u2014 you command a living swarm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Grexlings move, fight, and sacrifice themselves as one organism.</p><p c