870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CRAFT YOUR PERFECT SWARM</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genes</strong> \u2013 Combine gene types to create unique Grexling behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merging</strong> \u2013 Fuse genes into higher tiers for absurd power jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive Items</strong> \u2013 Heavy bonuses with real trade-offs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Level up, boost stats, and evolve your swarm\u2019s instinct.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging</strong> \u2013 Tear through the arena floor to find healing and diamonds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.poster.avif?t=1771947097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.webm?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.mp4?t=1771947097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent skill tree upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game on purpose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DISCOVER. MUTATE. REPEAT.</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New swarm species that changes playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare items and exotic genes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless builds that change <i>how your entire organism behaves</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP \u2014 more on the way.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FINAL CHALLENGE: &quot;Vanilla Mode&quot;</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset Skill Tree &amp; upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the <strong>final boss</strong> in pure vanilla chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MUSIC, POWER,  VFX</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GREX is powered by a thumping <strong>trance-techno soundtrack</strong> and glowy <strong>neon VFX</strong> \u2014 swirling trails, pulsing lights, and particle storms that turn your swarm into a cosmic supernova.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREX</strong> blends bullet-heaven chaos with deep buildcraft - but the star is your swarm.<br>Learn it. Shape it. Weaponize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you control the chaos you create?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun Swarming,<br>Mike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hamster On Coke Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/6147fee1e90cd897408e3471be74b38c9f9d2e76/header.jpg?t=1771947097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":